From a89ea8a70212f8aa6a9336250f6fb7f5eb75622d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:34:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cold start injector: extra injector pulsing while cranking
 cold (pro-style)

New output coldStartInjector. While cranking, and for coldStartInjectorAfterStart
seconds after start, with the coolant below coldStartInjectorMaxClt, it pulses every
coldStartInjectorPeriod ms for a time taken from a coolant temperature curve.
Failed coolant sensor or no pin set: nothing happens. TS: Cranking > Cold start injector.

